@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### 1. Without login: 401
# @no-cookie-jar
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders

### 2. Log in: 200, sets the SmtOrderManager.Auth cookie
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo",
  "password": "smt-demo"
}

### 3. With the cookie: the demo orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders

> {%
    client.global.set("acceptedOrderId", response.body.find(order => order.name === "Controllers and sensors").id);
    client.global.set("rejectedOrderId", response.body.find(order => order.name === "Backplanes").id);
%}

### 4. Who is logged in
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me

### 5. Download the order the line accepts: accepted is true, with a job reference
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{acceptedOrderId}}/download

### 6. Download the order the line rejects: 200, accepted is false, with the reason
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{rejectedOrderId}}/download

### 7. Violations: 422 with target and message per item
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/components
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "name": "RES-1K-0402", "description": null },
  { "name": "  ", "description": null }
]

### 8. Log out: 204, afterwards request 3 returns 401 again
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout